hToon_v2 — Ming cartoon shader (new, not based on hToon)

Assign: hToon/hToon_v2

Shading Part
- Auto: spec mask G 0.1~0.8 = cloth/silk, 0.9+ = metal, SDF toggle = face
- Face: SDF shadow, skin wrap, scatter
- Skin: wrap + terminator scatter
- Hair: Kajiya-Kay dual highlight
- Cloth: silk anisotropy
- Metal: matcap + gold

Face SDF
- Object +Z is face front
- Light Y 0 = full face shadow, 90 = half, 180 = fully lit
- Assign the SDF map to SDF / Shadow Mask and enable Use SDF Face Shadow

Start values
- Face: Part Face, Lit 0.52, Smooth 0.03
- Skin: Part Skin, Wrap 0.3~0.4
- Hair: Part Hair, Outline 0.8~1.2
- Cloth: Part Cloth
- Keep Vertex Color AO / Outline off unless the mesh has painted colors
